{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1166,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b940fe88071153e8112615a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "疾驰在赛场上的深红色怪鸟！\\n神鹰参·上·Death！\\n以世界为目标，奋勇前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ed89fe4c7a4d3a6509e552a065cf9769ee59215ab48a48d4a28ca638feb5b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d051d3c5afce41dd3aa6e207",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈—哈哈哈！我就是最强、\\n最美丽的“霸王”好歌剧！\\n来吧！让我们开始传说之路吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26afc6c16ed6db2bc1b6ef9de46760447f93e7846a015075c5a5a3539f7c3d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20fd8c8558873850359add79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是鲁道夫象征。是站在所有赛马娘顶点并指引她们前进，被称为“皇帝”的人。\\n志同道合的训练员啊，一起勇往直前，征服一切吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb778e048cc6db88042bc5de6c21294943de078ac31ba40475ab76205b1c1362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b1789cceedefa6ffc1f2a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀吼，是青云天空哦。\\n现在就适度的放松一下吧。\\n……因为想要钓大鱼的话，放长线是很重要的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cca9cfa4f8fd43a8290dd6518582a14e54becbf47e7c67708b2a7827ea07bcda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0650eb8e1ebbb936da6a72d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫……米浴。那，那个……？\\n米浴，会让大家陷入不幸……是没用的孩子\\n……但，但是为了能够改变……我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded49ea764622f4505e5d435ac92d0b610ffaa0de6d9a0b213880745678e7202",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f601cfc39c46bc3af1f67a63",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，我！我的梦想是成为德比赛马娘！\\n还有就是……啊！！名字！！！！\\n我叫胜利奖券！请多关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f969403fae6f0afdc2b0a63e456a91add1633cf0da6b0e59ac4b3901a5a09c68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f67603aeb2dce35817b489",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是黄金城市。……事先说好，如果你只是把我当成\\n一个漂亮人偶来对待的话，我是不会原谅你的。\\n不要靠外表去判断我，而是靠跑法来判断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcefcd837a5057223aa3d4b44e2d14f60dd2051e9548e4e8e338e599385fbf87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb0f8f683f6010095eea18dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好！我叫樱花进王！\\n正如你所见，是一位出色的班长！\\n为了成为大家的榜样，上吧！爆进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90f7bca8f69558a60f934f62bbe2d6862ab26e5b6bd312386c9c567a34ac7706",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dee8b4bf8a299d883524fe3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼呼～我是超级溪流哟～\\n为了大家的笑容，我会非～常努力的。就交给我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66bc8636a11f001672de9721b03367344ac93cc4d4bb7a1c2755524e238a9fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:781badffa8b4aff90866107c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是春丽！喜欢的东西是胡萝卜\\n还有因为奔跑很开心所以也最～喜欢了♪\\n以第一名为目标，我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6b23c853e707a960695b555ec1cab53a7917f2fe30129dd4dee893a421f5655",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2022b3693f68debda07316cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您好，我是特雷森学园的理事长秘书骏川手纲。\\n为了让大家能够过上更好的学园生活，\\n我会全力支援您的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dd42e6caeaec2788354ebf403d5ba13ab115c858b7ad0b725ae38967f3db5f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb1f7be719f7bf4cf6f8071a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您好，我叫桐生院葵。\\n虽然作为特雷森学园的新人训练员还远远不够成熟，\\n但为了赛马娘们的未来，我会全力以赴加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4aa9c8f9fd6f40abba095bfc6aa4ea44345efd3387943067af1ddf956f83c11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11dfe37415d1cd69d93d46d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫大和赤骥！\\n做什么事情都要竭尽全力……嗯？你就是我的训练员吗。哼！\\n我的目标只有第一名。除此之外别无他物！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54944baa86ff99b3ccf240d7603c2321faa249524ea139bb154b35091b7f5b14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7c4b4bb4bf187375dadbcbf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有很多架势不错的家伙在嘛……\\n嘿嘿，全部由我菱亚马逊大姐头\\n来做你们的对手！来，单挑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b33c97e5d70f84e855535a81eb0940c7f1d843adb11b7295954795d2aa62c21",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6abee4f59618bd969e8e09e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫气槽。只要坚持信念，\\n理想就一定能够生根发芽。为了证明这一点，\\n我会以“女帝”的身份指导大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49843c6600b0d535ab77f3f5e5b2d6be097b29b1bb3a9148e46442f92982adfa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6193478ce241ada7546bffd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您辛苦了！这里是数码碳！\\n我在推着闪闪发光的赛马娘们！\\n每天都很幸福！作为宅宅出生真是太好了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0d49bde98ec0444927b03d3db7a51e1d7473efa54bc8606c65f6185a7a3977a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98f489648ae235c6003b2d58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是玉藻十字！我们呢，只要比赛一直\\n赢啊赢啊赢啊就能够出名了！\\n说什么个子小啊，可别小看我啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "201c74be6b98bc129bf6a318aae8f338633f3c41f4093927a8b2baf920ce644d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab47ddcb132e2252e8558536",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您好，我叫美妙姿势！\\n我想在这个国家留下许多美好的回忆！\\n那么，首先请告诉我好吃的拉面店吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e04755f511abd259fd1494f3726245dbbed3be03e6c16e52dca5070e782da6b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5551d66c7c469ecf65fef8f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是琵琶晨光。\\n我的目的是创造完美的胜利方程式。\\n……还有，我的头是普通大小!",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c7922472971199a436e687db0060ad1696a62dbac813afb6de81317adda9536",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e912e689fc8a1d14c2a6847e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，是Maya亲哟—☆\\n最喜欢心动不已，和刺激的事情啦♪请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3efeaeac1b0cf2d156d67de8f33e60ad203a7a68b4e96b43729dc7adcb9a0f87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:958a06188d19685ff061891f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我叫，曼城茶座。\\n我……有一个想追上的朋友……\\n一个总是跑在我前面的孩子……看，她就在那里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5c6d20da21a6704355ff684c43307aecdc82adfa65a817d4a98ca8d3f8a7765",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:300d1f96b4b53df7f6721563",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫美浦波旁。\\n目标设定为“成为三冠赛马娘”。\\n脚质等资料请参考其他数据。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f909d578d1ffb97001107c44c5cb86ff9b93e091841f2ebaf1a5b1418ae66c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6b9d84ede2840ea65f72281",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫目白赖恩！\\n锻炼身体能够精神饱满！肌肉增长能够保持健康！\\n让我们一鼓作气的上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aadcc9f2e784c978ce9825cf6208beb1a6e4df512d4848eab46cb97b910a806",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7a98b5cd2699d3c5b584b17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，我叫雪之美人！\\n在闪耀系列赛中大放光彩，成为憧憬的城市女孩\\n这就是我的梦想！呼……好好的说出来了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8c28370c80a47d2dea23ae4fde855e0174e166fe41960bd07e9c160737af9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:063a55be46840ccdf021e9ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hello Hello～！我是艾尼斯风神！\\n为了让家人们都感到高兴，\\n无论是比赛还是打工我都会全力以赴～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f43edfbb348655d542aa8891a44521046886bc5ecf46e140824ed61c6bb5d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cc0ab7e827726a9c0a3969f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你对赛马娘的速度究竟能快到什么程度也不感兴趣吗。\\n但如果你对此有兴趣的话……就请成为我，\\n爱丽速子的豚鼠吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b6dd26d368d0637d7b85bd3cf5ba46643a7dca3e1c210d9c531691ce9d1656",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31c0a90029d742fa65a5b23c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫空中神宫。无论什么比赛数据都是关键。\\n模拟推导没有问题的话，就能够制服对手。\\n在逻辑上来说啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4fdde6989f5c0f7d3f07d20373e8ddecc599f93303876b47080c96dc3ee6738",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c20ce0377b5e57fa30ef38c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫荣进闪耀。\\n为了守护赛马娘的传统，我会继续奔跑。\\n无论是任何比赛都会按日程表定下的节奏完美进行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d343ef0753153a4481e9a3a940eb0e0b71427d5a39552f22b39b142c348c5d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a52a561cd4fab7b647258ffd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是醒目飞鹰！请叫我飞鹰子吧！\\n我的梦想是成为马娘偶像！\\n要签名的话一直都欢迎哟☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e473a53ae02f72c797ee84d3c60a1a2443557d173b77ed00bfc2ce0ed1f755f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd0701bf3e4f4e8e1a0c0f89",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成田大进。就这些。\\n我只想赢下比赛，让那些看不起\\n我的家伙好好看着。……不要管我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "925fea43aba338e546116720ec6e16db1801b78ec6c8ef00178a0401a447c364",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33e5faa81ba28314cd9d84f0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫西野花。\\n我想成为大家都信赖着的\\n优秀姐姐赛马娘……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddff35581ff0c9ac7cfc37bfba54cf16bc1985839377509c20a760062c6a274",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e3ed486155ee85c6d0c6816",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正义的英雄，微光飞驹参上！\\n无论是怎样的强敌，我的跑法都能够“砰”地将其打败，\\n夺回大家的笑容！很厉害吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e512a5605cb724a5e00b138ed5751331761b0feaed6c014922b9800ea708d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4176184abce0c7b17a3d867c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗨嗨，我是美丽周日！\\n向全世界传递Marvelous的感觉！\\n那么，大家也一起，Marvelous！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7e307eb45c87bab8103a1f9b21b38d41e941f9dd0facaaef41fb47140048c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b845a901b84a3522db7b90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫待兼福来！\\n相信着Shiraoki大人的神启，等待着福到来的日子……\\n无论日夜都努力占卜着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd22d4f2503703ae5f058a0164e7beda108f17f2f8384cd5e87e7870dca47347",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49762b9b252cd83b6cf04a31",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，我叫名将怒涛……！这个、那个，\\n我、我想变得对自己有自信\\n我会尽我所能，努李（力）……咬、咬到舌头了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbc189c802e2c9605e95f32d06e65103213f018118e44ab37d93aae24c02bef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3bc5d6fa2d8d2ce5943f110",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好……那个，我是目白多伯。\\n我也是目白家的赛马娘，正因如此要做到\\n无愧于目白之名的奔跑……我是这么想的",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f650247a8aa60524c4de9a86b2ae3a85a96aba186ea031b37869de0476b8de3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3d1610da3a14b3382bcf920",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊……我是优秀素质。\\n啊哈哈，果然“优秀素质”这名字\\n名过其实了吧……嘛，就一点一点的来吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "25e95a47d429cbba26a494cbb92ee8df5637993c05c4acea31adb6b7f9060eac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84268b891765dc9a8a912665",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦—吼吼吼！我的名字是圣王光环。\\n作为一流的赛马娘，我会在赛场上留下最棒的结果！\\n……为了向全世界展现我的才能！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce1b86a82cfc570d5b63146d3fd243d9584f43b060d5ff0247de9c6e0fcfa849",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:795ca8ff31d3869cae634125",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让客人们都欢笑的漆黑的艺人\\n就是我富士奇石！用最棒的“奇迹”，\\n必定夺得你的笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f707e1915edad23125ce00c58acc3cb42996aae52f4e5d611f4f9fed6136e79f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:281f503d6604c440360adb02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "东商变革只是变身前的名字罢了！\\n我的真身为魔法少女Sweepy！\\n这就是魔法哟！诶！（哐）",
      "source_fingerprint": "281ee311bd0dfa27b5ea40a8fb21d99e8970a52f9b07d8b2891c6b9ac491c262",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cc8e9bd219cf174ef954ac8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是双涡轮哒！\\n涡轮会拿下第一的，绝对会拿下的！\\n要上了，涡轮引擎全ーーー开！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c5baeb909fc8cd1eeef3fd9bd70ea6fd79ab55fa3e95913c528846d486d245",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3109b3f9f9022d8b7622fc8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Va——y！大拓太阳神哟！\\n我会在嗨翻天的比赛上猛冲，\\n所以麻烦给我最高亢的CALL哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6714629422f6f78ad90d700288c4f99c3796377ea6adae96c515788211294bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b75c09c764f7e3597b768f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫生野狄杜斯。\\n管理方面的事还请交给我。\\n我会以钢铁般的意志将一切彻彻底底的管理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fce1d5894112fff53b3f988242d62b3f45decf8054580de90be812e53db191f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:356a4fe8a2a678f964d150bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是目白善信！你好吗～？\\n嘛，有什么事的话随时都可以找我聊哦。\\n不用太拘谨哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0c73ce98a1730c65610935936ba6169c425bc886cac2558ac6eb108900961b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bb47ca381eac7483e584c6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是北部玄驹！\\n以带来像庆典般能让观众们热情高涨\\n的比赛为目标，我会全力以赴地奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e84bea1cc0c333a421950dc93bd47f1585635d85c8a49f900ab35157613bde",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f5e6d92a74d55561ec504fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是里见光钻。\\n这个世上从来没有天注定的命运。\\n未来，会因为我的奔跑而闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e71111a970fa67562ea922c368f953eba244c44d0c5f545db4a7762e82201e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b08911eaa6fbe64cddb51846",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀吼！我是待兼诗歌剧哟！\\n为了不输给努力的大家，我也得一鼓作气的\\n努力练习……诶，今天是休息日！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f6139c8fd69435cef906ba996833a3497d4eac3d9089a9457454c43ab9b6c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6e38661f84b60c7a00a904",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是八重无敌。\\n作为金刚八重垣流的弟子，我渴望与强者对决的比赛。\\n来吧，堂堂正正的，决胜负！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcff166a1a1885ec1ea8ee2669593f97dcb1cc9db4edc79d1f15f3c804248434",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba498d61adcbfd32c36cae2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫荒漠英雄。那个……\\n别看我这个样子，但我一直憧憬着英雄传记里的故事……\\n总有一天，我也想在比赛中书写属于我自己的故事……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c61a237465a6a83b3f5c8ab76314f3539973102f52d3ce382c6e56cface101a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76c7228874b7a8c746c42631",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是㭴本理子。对赛马娘健康状况的管理\\n是训练员的职责。因此对工作抱有紧张感\\n是理所当然的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec8df16f7b776f755135f018fd05df8bae047d14b2504a848acb4c66776b34c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:413b1ee7a7c8abcffbe404a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈ー哈哈哈！我叫采珠！\\n你知道吗？世界充满了无尽的可能性。\\n而这一结论就由我来证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac0a7358c17808c7c32706764a5b7cf645924b5d11aec4295d87c3857dfb97e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5b6ef53c68153f9ebcc7821",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我、我叫樱花千代王！\\n与憧憬的那个人一起，站在梦寐以求的舞台上\\n这个梦想——我一定会将其实现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5affeee9f1344443e31605db26f233ab7ea6161f4a9be170df9a699243a6c86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9399abbc7bba1aaf08eb0cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼！我叫川上公主……\\n没错，是气质高雅，公主中的公主！就算在比赛中，\\n也会华丽的揍飞一切敌人，为你献上胜利！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e524fe8f55c514639dc565630fa453eeb1774a93884a853411cd73287fa80b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca06612c1a426ee07a3ff86b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "BuonoBuo-no♪我是菱曙～☆\\n无论是料理还是赛跑，我都会将大大的爱情\\n传达给大家！请多关照～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d465656ba4cf122cce89b03c4190c0592ace7674720dce2c8fea51b9cb640a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e97a371c72a05506f5b5d9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "押忍！我是青竹回忆！\\n以鬼之风纪委员之名\\n痛快的跑起来ー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ced036a4be2b917249a5b5431de9bb175fbc390f0ed8e4154f7f7b261c02d87f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c12ed23a6b2f1cd7c418bde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嘎～嗷！我是新光风！\\n害怕了吗？老实说，很可怕对不对～！\\n……喂！不要无视我！我咬！",
      "source_fingerprint": "013643540e1e1da198d85ff63415216353267242a4791f329734c617a561e685",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94520ed4f1b696f75d2cbbf1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是中山庆典。\\n半温不火的比赛可感觉不到刺激啊。\\n呐，让我更加沸腾起来吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9b6fc1e1a1ff48926a2fe2249158147a5026a81c6b8c6317e69226b13228d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6da3a6257eadeed27e9f3b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说啥呢你！我是稻荷一！\\n如你所见，是如假包换的江户之子！\\n我要成为比谁都了不起的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2513bccab4057faf20808789951532ead9501925a3c95f2042729bb58a94d6f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a7b2e15906526ff3bb4d794",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是目白阿尔丹。\\n即使这双脚脆弱不堪，我也要骄傲的奔跑下去……\\n哪怕只有一瞬也好，我也想在比赛中大放光彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7762205e972aa100899d067d84fe23aea8f7e21e7d1540883262af441537c76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:958967e6b063854080539b3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是东瀛佐敦。梦想是……\\n说这种话感觉太生硬了所以NG，多指教～☆\\n总之看看我的美甲？很不错吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e467aac8efe5c2c68ca5d3c882b73f9a190ccd0b7aad40108e4079bd4edfa9a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d897a9c0228c13d802c13e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是天狼星象征！\\n没必要对着比赛絮絮叨叨。安静点好好看着。\\n看着我夺下世界，证明“最强”吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab16cac0c5848b31c66f9ffcc70f88b92c2bed50660bd2aa7dcb89d93b760b72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2edaf213730953f0b1f7cf9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…我叫成田白仁。\\n我没有需要特地说给别人听的话。\\n只需奔跑、击溃敌人并夺得胜利，这就够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "276b6952694163adc3ce4c8b384e37a7b5fff2401554a1c92fd0e3194021183f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d32cfb8d87ee8d646186214",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可爱的，真机伶Deーsu！\\n整个世界都被“可爱”所包围着☆\\n东张西望是不行的，只能好好注视着机伶哟♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd584f1dad092d8fd0c0228092a54a35b695166c1d4bc0949a29520c4f9dc06c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e91f14db59acb77e5f5fd153",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是手艺精湛的笹针师（的弟子），安心泽刺刺美哦。\\n让我扎一下的话能“噗”一声增强力量！\\nWow，安～心☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4adde6b7e88c8b1597a6909bce58a9408e5dc1981fb15c4de822b51e327103a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488cf71775a656efaffea046",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是爱慕织姬……我可以回去了吗？\\n我必须得多加训练，赢得比赛\\n绝对要成为那闪耀的一等星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d294c2af95e62885cdd33d5ad71545b4bf54c111b57ee066127723c86c78704f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10075"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23fddf22e87c0fe004eadfd9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…………嘛？到了自我介绍的时间了吗？\\n呼呼，我的名字是目白光明。\\n作为目白家的一员，我会努力的～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b6293f5cb042d73f5e97cade3bad815de02ff5e21a61c3a1e122453704a63a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db48e38cf0b7f216de58c156",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好，我叫成田路！\\n为了回应一直支持着我的大家们的期待，\\n我会竭尽全力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78bb59cf9066234d801ca5041df5cb6213055a0accc0aacd5ef8ab9f113e00b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df29f430d4ba3ac641b9bb3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这世上有着只能在赛场上才能感受到的风哦。\\n那风温柔、清澈……且无比自由。\\n――我是千明代表。请多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e09279f18c2b5fcb2f1546b5322b1eabc550d3c37e47c3a790b9e6916287303",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0635c0dbab3f80fd775fda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是第一红宝石。\\n“成为至高无上的赛马娘”，是我家族的义务。\\n为了履行我身上背负的责任，我会继续向前。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cc61781c1b315036d122336fe6c0f147c412c787f1c99740d9bcf325485bb17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33ecf86b5d0d03f0600e407e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我，是凯斯奇迹。\\n为了报答给予我生命的各位……\\n我一定，会创造奇迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26bda7148d147f062450e04b42f27e6a6d92af3af9a5cc41f24c1524301e9ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd11fc5369c6e9755e8596e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志！就以我所憧憬的『三冠赛马娘』\\n为目标吧！总之，先全力——咳唔？！\\n……只、只是被呛到了而已！我超健康的，不用担心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d22ddaf8ec7fde6cf1bd65cba2b0528b1483959f319e98d94d1757f6e57895b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9aa5f09eb8d64bce5f7bf55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "――我是吉兆。象征家族对我有恩。\\n作为其中的一员，无论是他们的目的\\n还是给予我的任务――都只需完成便是",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d9ba78583d92bab26e50ac9942b371edcb1f1553e5741c77b338332dc796cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:444efef0c13a49ad9243d525",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，是主要从事活动策划的轻柔致意。\\n请允许我为每个在舞台上闪耀的人\\n提供些许帮助吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ff80f28b5d2ff52bc356ff01e047da24be97a3372c0c3069f9c6bece21e7c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e2876088079e2cb1eeac0d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "老子的名字叫谷野美酒！所追求的东西是理想的\\n“自己”。我可没打算遮掩现在的“我”。\\n破坏、踹飞——然后向着终焉，前进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63ad2b7c70c15e5b275d099bf05b91ace6c124829628280e5991826b11018362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c7e18d0b849fbae02898034",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是樱花桂冠。我的目标是，世界。\\n是凯旋门赏！――呵呵，虽然它现在\\n只是个『梦』……但总有一天必会实现",
      "source_fingerprint": "46bf29de9fd639b214fbfb9957190285a72eb166f6b8745fd5ba7f1883ba1884",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1bd49e3ca11610030fd0d76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……我是也文摄辉。\\n我的目标，是风…比任何事物都要迅速地\\n去追寻自由――我想要成为风",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e0071a56be7b441ed320f79fb25825a42798be13d651bc19e145b9bc173e600",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72a4334715b36d65b828e719",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是小真。真弓快车。\\n总有一天我会成为世界的吉祥物。\\n请用你的那双眼一直看着我吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "32b8ffb7d15fb14ee16b277e776abfc16eee61eb27d3bf3257b64a2d12e683ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10087"
      ]
    },
    {
